      {
        "height": 1,
        "widget": {
          "text": {
            "content": "### 3. Erros - quais falhas ocorrem e que parcela das requisicoes representam?\n`app_request_count` separado por `status_class`. **Taxa de erro** = requisicoes `4xx` + `5xx` (numerador) dividido por todas as requisicoes (denominador), na mesma janela de 5 min. A distincao importa: `4xx` e o cliente pedindo o impossivel (campo faltando, id inexistente) e pode ser normal; `5xx` e a aplicacao falhando, e nunca e.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "style": {
              "backgroundColor": "#F1F3F4",
              "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
              "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
              "padding": "P_EXTRA_SMALL",
              "textColor": "#202124",
              "verticalAlignment": "V_CENTER"
            }
          }
        },
        "width": 12,
        "yPos": 10
      },
      {
        "height": 4,
        "widget": {
          "scorecard": {
            "sparkChartView": {
              "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
            },
            "thresholds": [
              {
                "color": "YELLOW",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "label": "atencao: acima de 5%",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "RED",
                "direction": "ABOVE",
                "label": "critico: acima de 20%",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ],
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilterRatio": {
                "denominator": {
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA"
                  },
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/app_request_count\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\""
                },
                "numerator": {
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA"
                  },
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/app_request_count\" resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" metric.labels.status_class=monitoring.regex.full_match(\"4xx|5xx\")"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "title": "Taxa de erro (fracao das requisicoes)"
        },
        "width": 3,
        "yPos": 11
      },
